WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.497
Welcome!

00:00:01.037 --> 00:00:01.677
I'm Tanda.

00:00:02.217 --> 00:00:03.617
Bring your questions and a pencil.

00:00:04.097 --> 00:00:06.177
We'll draw planet patterns, step into

00:00:06.177 --> 00:00:08.697
stories, and investigate how digital
things

00:00:08.697 --> 00:00:08.997
work.

00:00:09.417 --> 00:00:10.938
What does a digital key do?

00:00:11.578 --> 00:00:12.938
How can people check the same

00:00:12.938 --> 00:00:13.338
record?

00:00:14.658 --> 00:00:15.778
Choose a lesson with your grown

00:00:15.778 --> 00:00:16.018
-up.

00:00:16.333 --> 00:00:19.058
Watch, try the questions together, and

00:00:19.058 --> 00:00:20.558
tell each other what you discovered.
